      "locked": false,
      "text": "Window Function:\n\n\nNTH_VALUE(column): Nth row in the partition (Overall nth value and not from current row)\n\nLEAD and LAG function - Starts counting from the row next/previous to the current row\n\nFrames - Current Row is always the part of window\n\nCUM_DIST() window function\n",
      "fontSize": 14.249069533579899,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Window Function:\n\n\nNTH_VALUE(column): Nth row in the partition (Overall nth value and not from current row)\n\nLEAD and LAG function - Starts counting from the row next/previous to the current row\n\nFrames - Current Row is always the part of window\n\nCUM_DIST() window function\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
